Relief Forge is a Rust rewrite of the geometry in:

    prs-eth/depth-to-3d-print
    https://huggingface.co/spaces/prs-eth/depth-to-3d-print
    Copyright 2023-2025 Marigold Team, ETH Zurich
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The pipeline that file describes — median filter, min/max normalisation, a
near/far depth window, a height-field grid, and a frame of skirt, bezel, wall
and back plate — is reimplemented here, with the parameter names and ranges
kept so that settings and published examples transfer. No code was copied; the
Rust implementation streams rather than buffering, shares its seam indices
rather than merging duplicates afterwards, and fixes the three defects listed
in README.md.

